retropie-rom-manager (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Support all 37 RetroPie systems, with an "Add emulator" picker and
    removal of systems you no longer use.
  * Identify ROMs by their contents and catch games installed to the
    wrong system, with one-click move (adding the right system if needed).
  * Play games straight from the app with RetroPie's default emulator.
  * Fetch box art and metadata with Skyscraper, and install Skyscraper
    from inside the app when it's missing.
  * New interface built on GPUI Kit: box-art grid and list views, search,
    game details panel, drag and drop, light and dark themes.

 -- FA Saikat <fahimabrar.saikat@gmail.com>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:52:49 +0600

